        "lede_input": {
          "type": "lede",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>There is nothing in the formula to feel in the first hour, and that is deliberate. Anything that produced an immediate lift would be doing the borrowing trick, and the point is to work on the production line instead.</p><p>Three jobs, no overlap: produce NAD⁺, protect it from being broken down as fast as it is made, and give the cell what it needs to spend it. Every dose is at the level used in the research it comes from and printed in full on the label. Keep drinking your coffee if you want to - this changes what the coffee is covering for.</p>",
            "align": "left"
          }
