            "description_bullet": "<p><strong>Everything above is why the afternoon flattens.<br/>This is the part nobody sells you: you can produce energy instead of borrowing it.</strong></p><p>Caffeine and stimulants don't make energy. They pull it forward and charge you for it the next morning. MUTO works further back - fifteen ingredients feeding the cellular system that makes your own energy, so the afternoon doesn't collapse and the next day doesn't start in the red. And if you wear an Oura, Whoop, Garmin or Apple Watch, you're already measuring the system underneath it.</p>",
            "custom_class": ""
          }
        },
        "custom_liquid_NVnjAC": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"product-benifits\">\n  <div class=\"product-benifits-item\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/Muto_HRV.svg\" alt=\"BORROWED\" width=\"26\" />\n    <div class=\"product-benifits-info\">\n      <strong>BORROWED</strong>\n      <p>Coffee, pre-workout, the 3pm biscuit. None of it makes energy. It moves tomorrow's forward and adds interest..</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"product-benifits-item\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/Muto_Recovery_Score.svg\" alt=\"PRODUCED\" width=\"26\" />\n    <div class=\"product-benifits-info\">\n      <strong>PRODUCED</strong>\n      <p>Your cells make energy. MUTO feeds the system that does it - NAD⁺, methylated B vitamins, zinc and copper, working as one input.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"product-benifits-item\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/Muto_Energy.svg\" alt=\"COMPOUNDS\" width=\"26\" />\n    <div class=\"product-benifits-info\">\n      <strong>COMPOUNDS</strong>\n      <p>Stimulants reset to zero every morning. Cellular support builds. Week twelve should be better than week one, not the same day repeated.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"product-benifits-item\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/Muto_Readiness_Score.svg\" alt=\"MEASURABLE\" width=\"26\" />\n    <div class=\"product-benifits-info\">\n      <strong>MEASURABLE</strong>\n      <p>You already track the output. HRV, recovery, readiness - MUTO supports the biology those scores are reading. Take it for 90 days and watch your own baseline, not our claims.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
          }
        },
